{
  "id": "DEU.6",
  "number": "6",
  "bookId": "DEU",
  "reference": "Kumbukumbu La Sheria 6",
  "verseCount": 25,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "6",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "DEU 6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "6",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Hizi ndizo amri, masharti na maagizo ambayo Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wenu, aliniamuru niwafundishe, ili muyatekeleze katika nchi mnayokwenda kuimiliki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakati wote mlipo hai, mtapaswa kumcha Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wenu, na kuzitii kanuni zote na amri ninazowapeni nyinyi na wazawa wenu ili mpate kuishi maisha marefu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa hiyo enyi Waisraeli, muwe waangalifu kuzitekeleza ili mfanikiwe na kuongezeka sana katika nchi hiyo inayotiririka maziwa na asali kama alivyowaahidi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Basi sikilizeni enyi Waisraeli! Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wenu, ni Mwenyezi-Mungu mmoja.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6:4",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Mwenyezi-Mungu – Mwenyezi-Mungu mmoja:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Au Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wetu, ndiye Mungu pekee.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpendeni Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wenu, kwa moyo wenu wote, kwa roho yenu yote na kwa nguvu zenu zote. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wekeni mioyoni mwenu maneno hayo ninayowaamuru leo ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na kuwafundisha kwa uangalifu watoto wenu. Mtawasimulia muwapo mnakaa nyumbani au mlipo safarini au mnapolala au mnapoamka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yafungeni katika mikono yenu na kuyavaa katika vipaji vya nyuso zenu kama ukumbusho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaandikeni kwenye miimo ya milango yenu na malango ya miji yenu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kama vile Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wenu, alivyowaapia babu zenu, Abrahamu, Isaka na Yakobo, yeye atawapeni nchi yenye miji mikubwa na mizuri iliyostawi ambayo nyinyi hamkuijenga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyumba zitakuwa zimejaa vitu vizuri ambavyo nyinyi hamkuviweka, kutakuwa na visima ambavyo hamkuvichimba na mashamba ya mizabibu na mizeituni ambayo hamkuyapanda. Mwenyezi-Mungu atakapowapeleka kwenye nchi hiyo ambako mtakuwa na chakula chote mnachohitaji, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hakikisheni kwamba hamtamsahau Mwenyezi-Mungu aliyewatoa Misri ambako mlikuwa watumwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mtamcha Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wenu, mtamtumikia yeye peke yake na kuapa kwa jina lake peke yake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Msiabudu miungu mingine, miungu ya watu walio jirani nanyi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hasira ya Mwenyezi-Mungu isije ikawaka juu yenu, naye akawafutilia mbali kutoka duniani, maana Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wenu aliye kati yenu, ni Mungu mwenye wivu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Msimjaribu Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wenu, kama mlivyomjaribu kule Masa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakikisheni kwamba mnazitii amri zake Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wenu, maamuzi na masharti yake ambayo amewaamuru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fanyeni yale yanayompendeza Mwenyezi-Mungu, ili mpate kufanikiwa. Mtaweza kuimiliki nchi ile nzuri ambayo Mwenyezi-Mungu aliapa kuwapa babu zenu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na kwamba Mwenyezi-Mungu atawafukuza adui zenu kama alivyoahidi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Siku zijazo, watoto wenu wakiwauliza, ‘Nini maana ya maamuzi ambayo Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wetu, aliwaamuru kutenda?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyinyi mtawajibu hivi: ‘Sisi tulikuwa watumwa wa Farao, mfalme wa Misri, na Mwenyezi-Mungu akatuokoa kwa mkono wake wenye nguvu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa macho yetu wenyewe tulimwona akifanya ishara na miujiza na mambo ya kutisha na ya ajabu dhidi ya Wamisri, mfalme wao na wakuu wake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alitutoa Misri, akatuleta hapa na kutupa nchi hii, kama alivyoapa kwamba atawapa babu zetu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi, Mwenyezi-Mungu alituamuru kuzitii kanuni hizi zote na kumcha kwa faida yetu wenyewe; apate kutulinda daima kama hivi leo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tena tutakuwa waadilifu kama tukitimiza kwa uangalifu amri hizi zote mbele ya Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wetu, kama alivyotuamuru’.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
